  "title": "Past the End Date",
  "subtitle": "Dr Lindiwe Achterberg and the trials that keep going",
  "summary": "A short profile of Dr Lindiwe Achterberg, Lecturer in the School of Emergent Priorities, told largely in her own words. A former evaluator of pilot schemes, Dr Achterberg follows the trials that keep going past their end dates, from a demountable classroom still temporary decades on to an audit of relocated bus stops, pop-up lanes and other temporary traffic measures in which only nine per cent closed on schedule. The video also marks her research funding, the third-highest at the University, across two Anticipatory Capability Fund grants.",
